        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Duffell, Fred Niblo, James Mason, Robert Culp, Telly Savalas\n- Works: Inside Out\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter, actor, producer\n- Places: Canterbury, England\n\nFacts:\n- Fred Niblo was born on January 6, 1874, and he became an American pioneer film actor, director, and producer.\n- Peter Duffell was born in 1937 in Canterbury, England, and he is a British film and television director and screenwriter.\n- Inside Out is a 1975 British action thriller film.\n- Peter Duffell produced and directed Inside Out.\n- James Mason, Robert Culp, and Telly Savalas starred in Inside Out.\n- Fred Niblo died on November 11, 1948.",
